| **Contingency** | Contract conformance is verified by a single end-to-end integration test executed before any other verification. If it fails, no other testing proceeds until it passes. |
| **Owner** | Zapico, Zaki (implementation); Gregorio, Rhea Mae (verification) |
| **Trigger / Indicator** | Any HTTP 400 or HTTP 422 response during a controlled sync test using a known-valid payload. |
