| §1.2 | *"Generate automated end-of-event sales summaries, daily sales logs, and exportable Excel (.xlsx) **or PDF** performance reports."* | **Strike the PDF alternative.** Replace with: *"Generate automated end-of-event sales summaries, daily sales logs, and exportable Excel (.xlsx) four-tab performance reports."* | No PDF capability is scoped, specified, scheduled, or implemented in any revision. The approved reporting deliverable is the four-tab `.xlsx` workbook defined in §4.2.2. Retaining the PDF promise creates an unfulfillable contractual obligation and is the first item in the de-scoping order should schedule pressure arise. |
