### 5.1.1 Roadmap Overview

The project executes **ten delivery sprints** across a **137-day (19.5-week) academic window from 3 August 2026 to 18 December 2026**. Sprints are two weeks in duration except Sprint 9 and Sprint 10, which are adjusted to honour the 27 November feature freeze and the 18 December academic deadline.

The methodology synthesises four frameworks, each confined to a distinct functional domain to prevent methodological ambiguity:

- **Waterfall Governance (SDLC)** governs macro-level academic milestone verification, stage-gate approvals, documentation control, and formal submission deadlines.
